>0x12	string		ZZ		Zenographics ZjStream printer data (big-endian)
0	string		ZJZJ
>0x12	string		ZZ		Zenographics ZjStream printer data (little-endian)


#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Oak Technologies printer stream
