>49124		belong	<47104
>>49128		belong	<47104
>>>49132	belong	<47104
>>>>49136	belong	<47104	QL OS dump data,
>>>>>49148	string	>\0	type %.3s,
>>>>>49142	string	>\0	version %.4s

# Sinclair QL firmware executables (ThMO)
